  "read_abstract": "The multilinear extension of an n-person game v is a function defined on the n-cube IN which is linear in each variable and which coincides with v at the conrners of the cube, satisfying f(x) = v({i \u2223 xi = 1}). Multilinear extensions are useful as a help in computing the values of large games, and give a generalization of the Shapley value.",
